{{Lua|module=ItemSkins|data=ItemSkinsData}}
;Description
:Generates complete skins list for a given item.

; Usage
: <code><nowiki>{{ItemSkins | <1> }}</nowiki></code>

; Parameters
: <code>1</code> Exact item name as present in data.

;Example
<pre>
{{ItemSkins|Alarm Clock}}
</pre>

;Output
{{ItemSkins|Alarm Clock}}

;Example
<pre>
{{ItemSkins|Flashlight}}
</pre>

;Output
